<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT-BZW ups British Borneo.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-BZW ups British Borneo.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Oil exploration group British Borneo Plc was raised to &quot;buy&quot; from &quot;hold&quot; by BZW, market sources said on Monday.</p>
<p>Dealers said BZW had named British Borneo as its favourite among smaller exploration stocks. Analysts at the investment bank could not immediately be reached for comment.</p>
<p>-- David Holmes, London Newsroom +44 171 542 4367</p>
</text>
